This plugin is a modified OMP port of agent, skill, and documentation-server configuration material from oh-my-openagent, Copyright the oh-my-openagent contributors. It is an independent adaptation for OMP's `task`, IRC, eval, `todo`, `browser`, `lsp`, `local://`, skill, and MCP surfaces. This plugin bundles selected adapted TypeScript runtime components listed below, but does not bundle the upstream runtime as a whole, upstream workspace packages, a native comment-checker executable, a downloader, or third-party runtime dependencies.

